  <h2 id="source-information-heading">Source and referral information</h2>
  <p>When you arrive at this website through a referral link, publication, social post, campaign link, or another website, Convera Strategies may temporarily retain first-party session information such as the referring page or domain, the landing page, and standard campaign parameters included in the link. This information may be attached to a Contact or Follow the Work submission so Convera can understand how people find the work and which public pathways are useful.</p>
  <p>This attribution is limited to the current browser session. Convera does not use this feature to fingerprint visitors or create cross-site profiles. Information is submitted to Convera only when you choose to submit a form. Follow the Work requests are not transferred to a third-party mailing provider until a provider is selected and the applicable consent, confirmation, unsubscribe, and retention practices are configured.</p>
